      "text_unit_id": "tu_0002",
      "verbatim_text": "2. In patients with prior MI and recurrent episodes of symptomatic sustained VT, or who present with VT storm and have failed or are intolerant of amiodarone (LOE: B-R) (S7.1.3-4) or other antiarrhythmic medications (LOE: B-NR) (S7.1.3-5–S7.1.3-9), catheter ablation is recommended (S7.1.3-10–S7.1.3-12)."
